{"4537370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neon Shifter", "steam_appid": 4537370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4843560], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/fd73600e79f6d0d8260e4fcad792ae7b.avif?t=1783506171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras_big/fd73600e79f6d0d8260e4fcad792ae7b.avif?t=1783506171 width=1560 height=504 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade racer infused with roguelite elements, fuelled by music, mayhem, and pure forward momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/d567794413548263d6367c668501cf76.avif?t=1783506171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras_big/d567794413548263d6367c668501cf76.avif?t=1783506171 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEON SHIFTER pulls you into a high-speed, audio-driven road trip, where every move or crash can power your engine and build your advantage. Inspired by the likes of <i>Burnout Revenge</i>, this is a racer about aggression, risk, and relentless chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/97a2279f44d7f6665c4ecb4e7406045a.avif?t=1783506171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras_big/97a2279f44d7f6665c4ecb4e7406045a.avif?t=1783506171 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a vehicle tearing through surreal, procedurally generated highways, neon coastlines, industrial docks, and chaotic cityscapes, all powered by the electrifying tracks of Savlonic. Your job is to tear up the roads: earning boost builds with aggression, where traffic density escalates with the beat, and every run becomes your own playable music video.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AGGRESSION IS YOUR WEAPON.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget careful driving or racing! This is about pure carnage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash through traffic to build your boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ram your opponents and pursuers off the road.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take many risks to multiply your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, maintain speed at all costs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>12 TRACKS. ONE ROUTE. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across a country-spanning journey featuring 12 unique environments, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon coastlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial shipping docks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desert mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night metropolis highways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carnival chaos zones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracks are affected by the chaos on the road, which are procedurally generated to keep every run fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHORT RUNS. HIGH SCORES. ONE MORE RACE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for instant fun and repeat play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, high-intensity races.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets and hidden alternate routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your runs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/63b30cb780ec8171ea7d78612db08449.avif?t=1783506171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras_big/63b30cb780ec8171ea7d78612db08449.avif?t=1783506171 width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local split-screen battles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply race, or just wreck your friends, because sometimes winning isn’t enough. Sometimes you just want to ruin someone else’s run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD OF SAVLONIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the anarchic universe of SAVLONIC, a fictional band created by Jonti “Weebl” Picking, NEON SHIFTER blends music, rebellion, and absurd humour into a bold, stylised world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core: Technology belongs to everyone. Not the elite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/516f3c20b5ee06ad9a6fee53b3658b59.poster.avif?t=1783506171\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/516f3c20b5ee06ad9a6fee53b3658b59.webm?t=1783506171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/516f3c20b5ee06ad9a6fee53b3658b59.mp4?t=1783506171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music-driven gameplay that directly affects speed, chaos, and boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive, high-speed arcade racing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements mutate the chaos in fun and unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic-smashing, boost-building, combat driving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 tracks, interconnected with procedural elements for replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-chasing, short-session design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylised neon world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique soundtrack composed by SAVLONIC especially for this game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR SPEED. DESIGNED FOR CHAOS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If, like us, you miss the days of pure arcade racing, where speed mattered, and chaos was rewarded, this is your next obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/6fc8ea0bc0f8b33a87aa3905a2b61bf5.poster.avif?t=1783506171\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/6fc8ea0bc0f8b33a87aa3905a2b61bf5.webm?t=1783506171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/6fc8ea0bc0f8b33a87aa3905a2b61bf5.mp4?t=1783506171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW AND EMBRACE THE CHAOS!</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/fd73600e79f6d0d8260e4fcad792ae7b.avif?t=1783506171\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras_big/fd73600e79f6d0d8260e4fcad792ae7b.avif?t=1783506171 width=1560 height=504 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade racer infused with roguelite elements, fuelled by music, mayhem, and pure forward momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla