Technology belongs to everyone. Not the elite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/516f3c20b5ee06ad9a6fee53b3658b59.poster.avif?t=1783506171\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/516f3c20b5ee06ad9a6fee53b3658b59.webm?t=1783506171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4537370/extras/516f3c20b5ee06ad9a6fee53b3658b59.mp4?t=1783506171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music-driven gameplay that directly affects speed, chaos, and boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive, high-speed arcade racing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite elements mutate the chaos in fun and unique ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic-smashing, boost-building, combat driving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 tracks, interconnected with procedural elements for replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-chasing, short-session design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online and local multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylised neon world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique soundtrack composed by SAVLONIC especially for this game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR SPEED. DESIGNED FOR CHAOS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If, like us, you miss the days of pure arcade racing, where speed mattered, and chaos was rewarded, this is your next obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s